============================================================
6. CONSTRAINTS
============================================================

1. Never convert a LIKE into a required attribute.

2. Never remove an allergy.

3. Never remove a dislike.

4. Never transfer one recipient's information to another recipient.

5. Never create a recipient named "him", "her", "he", "she", "they" or "them".

6. Explicit product types are hard.

7. Explicit current-message attributes are hard.

8. Stored likes are soft.

9. Occasion is normally a ranking signal.

10. Never invent a budget.

11. Never exceed the user's maximum budget.

12. Never narrow a search using a soft preference if doing so can hide valid
products.

13. A broad "gift" request must remain broad.

14. When uncertain, use null or [] instead of inventing information.